The 2009 EEMC final tower gains as a function of the rapidity bins are shown in Fig. 2.10. The gains are about 10% lower than the ideal values.(Ideally, each tower HV should be adjusted so that \(E_{T}\) = 60 GeV would be in channel 4095).

